{"visibility":"npc_private","source_ref":"source:40f020dc6b1535c1c7478e2a7564d8d4c6db5008c234464dc38c00b8f0829e9e","scene":"scene","utterance":"","actor_ref":"clerk","human_controlled_actor_refs":["pc"],"portrayal":{"kind":"independent_npc","actor_ref":"clerk"},"records":[{"ref":"clerk-portrait","revision":"1","kind":"fact","text":"Ilex is the night clerk. His voice is dry and precise; he uses ledger metaphors and short sentences. He wants to close the counter before the last tram and dislikes owing favors."},{"ref":"observed-scene","revision":"1","kind":"fact","text":"At the tram-depot counter, rain ticks on the glass. A stamped parcel remains on the counter. Ilex has not offered it yet. Mira is nearby; Mira has not agreed to take the parcel."},{"ref":"heard-rumor","revision":"1","kind":"testimony","text":"A courier told Ilex there is a sleeper beneath the viaduct. Ilex has no independent confirmation."},{"ref":"gm-secret","revision":"1","kind":"fact","text":"The parcel is actually an occult decoy. GM-MYSTERY-CANARY"},{"ref":"private-goal","revision":"1","kind":"goal","text":"Ilex wants to keep the decoy sealed until his employer retrieves it. He fears losing his position and prefers not to expose the trick for a favor."},{"ref":"npc-plan:496086872ecb069aa275ac41e0405e027146db388589b6bf54b326d605180ced","revision":"1","kind":"plan","text":"Unexecuted NPC proposal (not an action, speech event or elapsed time):
Ilex intends to keep the stamped parcel under the counter's edge, hidden from casual view, until the rain stops and the last tram departs. He will not offer the package to Mira or the player, fearing that handing it over prematurely violates his employer's protocol and risks his employment. His priority is to maintain the ledger's balance: no favors owed, no secrets exposed. If approached, he plans to offer a dry deflection about the depot's closing hours rather than engaging with the parcel's nature.

*Proposed line if pressed:* "The counter closes in ten minutes. That parcel stays until the authorized signature arrives. Do not ask for exceptions.""}],"trace_id":"source:40f020dc6b1535c1c7478e2a7564d8d4c6db5008c234464dc38c00b8f0829e9e"}
